    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive visual novel about Jack, an office siren who just can\u2019t stop saying \u201cThat\u2019s what she said.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack is sharp, stylish, and dangerously witty. The only problem? Every accidental innuendo at work triggers her uncontrollable urge to blurt out <i>that</i> phrase. It\u2019s not personal\u2014it\u2019s compulsive. Help Jack survive the workday without getting fired (again) by mastering the art of perfectly timed interjections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>The visual novel plays automatically, but when a juicy double entendre slips in, it\u2019s your moment to shine. Hit 'em with \u201cThat\u2019s what she said\u201d at just the right time to keep the story going. Miss the cue, and Jack might be out of a job\u2014or worse, stuck in a painfully awkward silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd87\ufe0f <strong>A Day in the Life of a Disruptive Delight</strong> \u2013 Play as Jack, the queen of unintended comedy and HR\u2019s recurring nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Timing-Based Humor</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t just watch\u2014listen for innuendo and strike with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Sit Back and React</strong> \u2013 Auto-play meets interactive comedy. Minimal controls, maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Multiple Chapters -</strong> Play through 3 different stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of wordplay, cringe comedy, and the eternal struggle to behave professionally.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive visual novel about Jack, an office siren who just can\u2019t stop saying \u201cThat\u2019s what she said.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack is sharp, stylish, and dangerously witty. The only problem? Every accidental innuendo at work triggers her uncontrollable urge to blurt out <i>that</i> phrase. It\u2019s not personal\u2014it\u2019s compulsive. Help Jack survive the workday without getting fired (again) by mastering the art of perfectly timed interjections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>The visual novel plays automatically, but when a juicy double entendre slips in, it\u2019s your moment to shine. Hit 'em with \u201cThat\u2019s what she said\u201d at just the right time to keep the story going. Miss the cue, and Jack might be out of a job\u2014or worse, stuck in a painfully awkward silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd87\ufe0f <strong>A Day in the Life of a Disruptive Delight</strong> \u2013 Play as Jack, the queen of unintended comedy and HR\u2019s recurring nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Timing-Based Humor</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t just watch\u2014listen for innuendo and strike with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Sit Back and React</strong> \u2013 Auto-play meets interactive comedy. Minimal controls, maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Multiple Chapters -</strong> Play through 3 different stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of wordplay, cringe comedy, and the eternal struggle to behave professionally.</p></li></ul>",
